{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "fr",
  "levels": [
    {
      "id": "level_06",
      "title": "Ceux qui sont partis",
      "before": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "J’ai une route. Elle contourne la partie la plus dense du champ."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Et les secours ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Ils ont reçu les coordonnées. Ils veulent des relevés plus précis avant d’envoyer un équipage."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Donc ils attendent."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Ils évitent d’ajouter une deuxième disparition à la première."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "J’ai trouvé quelque chose dans la capsule."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Quoi ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Elle a bien quitté la Lisière il y a douze ans. Six personnes à bord."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Elles ont pu rejoindre un autre vaisseau."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Le sas a été ouvert onze minutes après le départ. Puis plus aucune entrée."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Ça ne nous dit pas ce qui leur est arrivé."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Non."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Mais quelqu’un savait encore ouvrir ce sas."
        }
      ],
      "after": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "J’ai retrouvé la liste des passagers de la Lisière."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Les six de la capsule ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Tout le vaisseau. Quarante-trois personnes."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Quarante-trois…"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Équipage compris."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Ils transportaient quoi ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Du matériel d’extraction. C’est ce que dit le rapport public."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Et le reste ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je n’ai que le rapport public."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Je pensais trouver une épave."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Tu peux encore faire demi-tour."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Je sais."
        }
      ],
      "gameplay_notes": [
        "Quitter le champ selon le trajet établi par Nora : astéroïdes modérés puis passages resserrés ; collecter une quantité raisonnable d'éclats rencontrés sur la route, sans obligation de tout ramasser. Objectif prioritaire : atteindre la sortie. Durée visée : 90–180 s."
      ],
      "illustration_before": "illustrations/campaign_06.png",
      "illustration_after": "illustrations/campaign_06.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "level_07",
      "title": "Dans le bruit",
      "before": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Tu arrives dans le nuage. Après ça, ma voix risque de couper."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Combien de temps ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Quelques minutes, si tu gardes le cap."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Et le signal ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Ses coordonnées sont enregistrées. Tu peux continuer sans le recevoir."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Tu dis ça comme si c’était rassurant."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je préfère que tu suives une position fixe plutôt qu’une voix au milieu des parasites."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Si tu entends quelque chose, enregistre-le. N’essaie pas de répondre en changeant de trajectoire."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Compris."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "On se retrouve de l’autre côté."
        }
      ],
      "after": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Nora ? Je suis sorti."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je te reçois. Tu as eu des dégâts ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Rien que je puisse voir. Mais j’ai reçu une voix."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Fais écouter."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "transmission_inconnue",
          "display_name": "Voix enregistrée",
          "portrait": "portraits/transmission_inconnue.png",
          "text": "…six personnes… sas secondaire… pas le principal…"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Six personnes. Comme dans la capsule."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Ça pourrait être un message de l’évacuation."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Pourquoi il arrive maintenant ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Si une alimentation s’est rétablie, une vieille transmission peut repartir."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Donc on suit peut-être des gens morts depuis douze ans."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "On suit un vaisseau qui émet aujourd’hui. C’est tout ce qu’on sait."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "D’accord."
        }
      ],
      "gameplay_notes": [
        "Traverser un nuage chargé, dangers électriques introduits progressivement ; la radio est coupée pendant une portion du trajet (sans conséquence sur la compréhension). Objectif : atteindre la sortie en évitant les décharges. Durée visée : 100–190 s."
      ],
      "illustration_before": "illustrations/campaign_07.png",
      "illustration_after": "illustrations/campaign_07.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "level_08",
      "title": "À contre-courant",
      "before": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Nora, regarde les trajectoires."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je vois."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "C’est comme tout à l’heure."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Tu es pourtant loin du premier champ."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Les éclats se regroupent encore."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Et tes capteurs enregistrent la même perturbation."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Une autre tempête ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Peut-être. Attends…"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Le signal devient plus fort juste avant chaque variation."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "La Lisière fait bouger les astéroïdes ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je n’ai pas dit ça. Les deux phénomènes peuvent avoir la même cause."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Mais ils sont liés."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Ça, oui. Ça commence à y ressembler."
        }
      ],
      "after": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "J’ai passé la dernière vague."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Tes relevés viennent de compléter le dossier transmis aux secours."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Ils vont venir ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Ils évaluent le risque."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Tu as dit quarante-trois personnes."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je leur ai dit aussi."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Si cette chose a provoqué la première tempête… c’est elle qui nous a permis de trouver la capsule."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Ou c’est elle qui l’a dégagée."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Tu crois que quelqu’un l’a fait exprès ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je crois qu’on a trop peu d’informations."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Et qu’on va bientôt en avoir davantage."
        }
      ],
      "gameplay_notes": [
        "Traverser des vagues de trajectoires d'astéroïdes annoncées clairement ; récolter des relevés accessibles pour synchroniser les mesures. Objectif : relever les perturbations et atteindre la sortie. Durée visée : 120–210 s."
      ],
      "illustration_before": "illustrations/campaign_08.png",
      "illustration_after": "illustrations/campaign_08.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "level_09",
      "title": "Ne laissez pas repartir",
      "before": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "La route extérieure n’est plus praticable."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "On attend que ça passe ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Tu peux. Mais la perturbation augmente."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "L’autre passage ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "La haute atmosphère. Tu restes au-dessus des couches épaisses."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "La Traverse n’a pas été conçue pour ça."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Pour traverser une atmosphère entière, non. Pour en longer la bordure, oui. Tant que tu ne descends pas."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Et si les décharges me poussent vers le bas ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Tu renonces au passage. Même si tu es presque arrivé."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "D’accord."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je veux que tu le penses, Élias."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Je le pense."
        }
      ],
      "after": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Le signal est beaucoup plus net. J’ai récupéré un autre fragment."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Écoute-le."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "transmission_inconnue",
          "display_name": "Voix enregistrée",
          "portrait": "portraits/transmission_inconnue.png",
          "text": "…ne laissez pas… repartir… même si…"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Repartir quoi ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Le vaisseau, peut-être."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Pourquoi empêcher des gens de partir ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "On ignore à qui cette personne parlait."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "On ignore beaucoup de choses."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Oui. Alors quand tu arriveras, tu observes. Tu ne réactives rien."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Même pour ouvrir un accès ?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Tu vérifies d’abord ce que tu alimentes."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "Nora…"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "nora",
          "display_name": "Nora",
          "portrait": "portraits/nora.png",
          "text": "Je l’ai aussi."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "elias",
          "display_name": "Élias",
          "portrait": "portraits/elias.png",
          "text": "C’est beaucoup plus grand que je pensais."
        }
      ],
      "gameplay_notes": [
